    <string name="settings_inbox_decision">A question an agent asked you, with options and a recommendation. Leaves when you answer it or it is withdrawn.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_question">An agent question assigned to you. Leaves when answered, dismissed or withdrawn. Answer from Inbox or its conversation.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_card">A card an agent moved to Review or Blocked, for the person who handed it off. Leaves when the card moves on.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_followup">After a call with people outside the team, a drafted follow-up and the tasks it proposed. Leaves when you approve or dismiss it, or after a week.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_talk">A subject conversation with something unread. Leaves when read.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_guest">A guest or an organization wrote on a subject you can see, and nobody here has answered. Leaves when someone replies or you dismiss it.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_support">Starlings support answered a question you asked in Help. Leaves when you read it.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_task">A proposed task. Leaves when accepted or declined.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_note">A note not yet filed. Leaves when filed or deleted.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_sales">A CRM touch with no lead yet, with Sales on. Leaves when a lead starts or it is dismissed.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_comment">An open comment thread on a document about your subjects. Leaves when resolved.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_booking">A guest booked, moved or cancelled a time on your page. Leaves when filed, dismissed, or the meeting starts.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_invitation">Someone invited you to an event. Leaves when you accept, decline or say maybe, or when the event ends.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_forwarded">An event read from mail you forwarded to calendar@. Leaves when you add or discard it, or after a week.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_interest">A company filled in /interest, for admins. Leaves when dismissed.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_submission">Someone filled in one of the workspace’s public forms, for the people the form names. Leaves when dismissed.</string>
    <string name="settings_inbox_commercial">An offer that expires within a week, or a license that renews within 30 days, on a lead or organization you can see, with Sales on. Leaves when it is decided or renewed, or when dismissed.</string>
